# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files.
#
# Rationale: Supervisor authors the shared-core, Edition mirrors it.
# Without this, Windows checkout produces CRLF on one side and LF on
# the other, causing false-positive drift in shared-core-coherence-audit
# (Supervisor-side skill).
#
# Added 2026-05-26 (audit: Alex_ACT_Supervisor/docs/audits/shared-core-coherence-2026-05-26.md).

* text=auto eol=lf

# Treat known binary types explicitly so they're never normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.vsix binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
